  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.0: Security and reliability release. Remote file names and paths are validated and quoted to prevent smbclient command injection; names containing quotes, semicolons, wildcards or control characters are now rejected. Passwords are passed to smbclient through the child environment instead of credentials files. Cancelled or timed-out pooled commands now invalidate the session (new configurable command timeout) and are never replayed. Same-share moves use server-side rename and no longer overwrite or roll back existing destinations. Pooled sessions and factory-created handlers are disposed correctly. Added WslDistribution option, BSD/macOS script support, unified NT_STATUS error classification, and fixed lazy native enumeration. Removed GeneratePackageOnBuild.",
